  "question": "A bag contains Rs.3,000, the notes of which are in the denominations of Rs.50, Rs.100 and Rs.10. If the notes of Rs.100, Rs.50 and Rs.10 are in the ratio of 5 : 8 : 10, then the number of the notes of Rs.50 in the bag will be:",
