  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nTotal = Rs. 3,000\n\n**Solution:**\n\n100(5m) + 50(8m) + 10(10m) = 3000\n\n500m + 400m + 100m = 3000\n\n1000m = 3000\n\nm =3\n\nNow, 8m = 8 x 3 = 24\n\n**Hence, 24 notes of 50Rs.**",
